      "value": "Aika and I collaborated on reproducing the above (hence the 'my'/'her' in the video evidence section.)\nThis is the bug I've flagged to TCL/Phasedragon/Tupper - we were finally able to get what we think is an unambiguous repro. I can provide the output logs for the test on request (launched using all of --enable-debug-gui --enable-sdk-log-levels --enable-udon-debug-logging)",
      "viewerReactions": null
