      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: hasn't happened recently, no. I personally haven't noticed anything bad on IKv2. Unsure if the world id's above are still bugged since map development moved on since then.\nThe most concise description of the issue was: flooding the world with constant object sync events => FBT IK fails to update => half-body IK fails to update => people stop moving, but voice chat still works",
