  "details": "I'm one of the mappers for Bricktown, the Golden Gator lobby run by Rob \"roflgator\" Malecki. We've managed to reproduce an unusual bug that primarily affects perceived IK from VR users, especially those in full-body.\nDesktop players are not affected especially heavily, the bug primarily manifests in the halting of positional/rotational movement and a full IK freeze, even as audio data passes relatively unobstructed. There is some client lag (as opposed to network lag) when new members join the lobby, but that is likely unrelated.\nOne prerequisite for witnessing the bug seems to be a population of 35+ users. We're unable to determine whether this is a direct condition for the bug reproducing or whether the bug consistently reproduces as a result of the high number of active FBT users.\nMost noticeably, the frozen IK occurs in waves that seem to affect everyone concurrently (but at irregular intervals) - not just one person, or at different times for each user.\nVideo evidence:\nhttps://youtu.be/qd86Uz2sBqo?t=4754 (Yewnyx - my volume is a bit high, and I left it at a low bitrate, oops)\nhttps://youtu.be/xi0ShLDVN9U?t=4545 (Aika - doesn't include her audio, video HQ)\nhttp://viewsync.net/watch?v=qd86Uz2sBqo&t=4754&v=xi0ShLDVN9U&t=4545\navatar: avtr_e5f09d87-d43f-45e3-ace5-26eab5791eeb https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_e5f09d87-d43f-45e3-ace5-26eab5791eeb\nworld with easy repro: wrld_7a0198e8-86b2-465b-8c8d-bd61bd73646e https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_7a0198e8-86b2-465b-8c8d-bd61bd73646e - Bricktown, with Udon scripts\nworld with difficult or no repro: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_07a8944f-41c2-4f11-8c57-28139afd43ff - Bricktown, without udon scripts",
